WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Come with us. It's too dangerous here.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:03,930
We are going to the plateau

3
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:07,140
It would be better if it was more stable over there.

4
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,740
I'll follow you little tiger

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,220
can't live without me

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:15,420
Great. My name is Xu Qing.

7
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,380
His name is Han Jiangxue

8
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,740
That handsome guy’s name is Su Hao

9
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,100
We will protect you from now on

10
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:23,300
The day the end comes

11
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,080
My parents and I were at the zoo

12
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:28,450
Just that day

13
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,200
They are all gone

14
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,170
She's Xiaohu's mother

15
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,770
Slap the iron cage and rush out

16
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,580
Kill all the mourning stones that have been laid over.

17
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:41,130
He took me back hiding in the cupboard again

18
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:42,770
Later I followed them

19
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,690
Eat what's left

20
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:48,020
Slowly, these ears and tail grew.

21
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,600
He put the beasts in the square stone to death

22
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,920
Everything is clean

23
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,120
Hit anyone who comes

24
00:00:54,910 --> 00:00:56,390
Until I met that poisonous snake
